abstract: >
  Code for the QuantumCLEF 2026 Task 1B submission by Team Skywalkers.
  Implements an Optuna-tuned QUBO feature selection pipeline for Item-KNN
  recommender systems, executed via Simulated Annealing and D-Wave QPU.
